  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-bg"></div>
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="./index.html">Home</a> &nbsp;✦&nbsp; Destinations</p>
    <h1>Shore to Shore,<br><em>Coast to Coast</em></h1>
    <p>There's a whole world of possibilities to discover and explore. Whether you're craving culture, adventure, luxury, or pure relaxation — there's a perfect destination for every kind of traveler.</p>
