      <!-- Europe -->
      <a href="https://www.starlight2travel.com/europe" class="dest-card" id="europe" target="_blank">
        <div class="dest-bg europe"></div>
        <div class="dest-overlay"></div>
        <div class="dest-globe">🏛</div>
        <div class="dest-content">
          <span class="dest-tag">Culture</span>
          <h2>Europe</h2>
          <p>Where the next country is just a drive away and the sites have lasted for century after century. Grab your walking shoes for endless culture and world-famous landmarks.</p>
          <span class="dest-link">Explore Europe &nbsp;→</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- United States — large -->
      <a href="https://www.starlight2travel.com/united-states" class="dest-card large" id="usa" target="_blank">
        <div class="dest-bg usa"></div>
        <div class="dest-overlay"></div>
        <div class="dest-globe">🗽</div>
        <div class="dest-content">
          <span class="dest-tag">Domestic</span>
          <h2>United States</h2>
          <p>No need to locate the passport when there's so much to cross off the bucket list in the states! Much like island destinations, each state in the U.S. has its own unique flavor and charm, appealing to a wide variety of vacationers.</p>
          <span class="dest-link">Explore the USA &nbsp;→</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- South Pacific & Asia -->
